WEBVTT

39:02.325 --> 39:03.492
I don't know.

39:03.618 --> 39:05.870
We go home with an army.

39:07.955 --> 39:10.249
With Khal Drogo's army.

39:11.459 --> 39:14.462
I would let his whole tribe fuck you,

39:14.587 --> 39:17.673
all 40,000 men and their horses too,

39:17.798 --> 39:19.467
if that's what it took.

39:26.807 --> 39:28.267
(KISSES)
